{% doc %}
  Renders the complete About Us page content for Bike Bee.
  Includes brand story, mission, core values, competitive differentiators, and CTA.
{% enddoc %}

<article class="page-wrapper">
  <div class="page-container page-container--wide">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="page-eyebrow">⚡ CALIFORNIA BASED • RIDERS FIRST</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">About Bike Bee</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Pioneering sustainable, high-performance electric dirt bikes for riders across the United States.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="page-container">
      <section class="content-section about-hero">
        <h2>Powering Your Off-Road Adventures</h2>
        <p>Welcome to <strong>Bike Bee</strong>, your premier destination for cutting-edge electric dirt bikes and off-road vehicles. Headquartered in Dinuba, California (430 W Ventura St, Dinuba, CA 93618), we are a passionate collective of riders, technicians, and electric mobility advocates dedicated to bringing exhilarating, eco-conscious riding experiences to enthusiasts nationwide.</p>
        <p>We believe off-road recreation should deliver raw adrenaline and instantaneous power without the fumes, high maintenance, or noise pollution of traditional gas powerplants. That conviction drives everything we do.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section about-mission">
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>At Bike Bee, our mission is clear: to equip American riders with highest-tier, eco-friendly electric dirt bikes that refuse to compromise on power, reliability, or thrill. We specialize in the <strong>2026 Sur-Ron Light Bee X</strong>—widely recognized as the pinnacle of lightweight electric trail and dirt engineering.</p>
        <p>Every bike we supply is backed by direct US-based support, an unwavering commitment to rider safety, and transparent customer care from order to unboxing and beyond.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section about-values">
        <h2>Our Core Values</h2>
        <div class="page-grid">
          <div class="page-card">
            <div class="page-card__icon">🏍️</div>
            <h3>Performance Excellence</h3>
            <p>We only offer machines that satisfy stringent benchmarks for power delivery, chassis rigidity, suspension compliance, and long-term durability. Every batch is rigorously inspected to ensure peak performance.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="page-card">
            <div class="page-card__icon">🌱</div>
            <h3>Sustainability</h3>
            <p>Electric dirt bikes produce zero tailpipe emissions, protect natural trail environments, and minimize noise disturbance. We are committed to fostering responsible, future-ready recreation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="page-card">
            <div class="page-card__icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Customer First</h3>
            <p>Your riding confidence is our top priority. From pre-purchase advice to ongoing technical troubleshooting, our California team guarantees 24-hour response times during business days.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="page-card">
            <div class="page-card__icon">🛠️</div>
            <h3>Expert Support</h3>
            <p>We are riders and mechanical specialists ourselves. We know motor controllers, battery chemistry, and suspension tuning inside out, providing you with authentic, knowledgeable guidance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section about-why-us">
        <h2>Why Choose Bike Bee?</h2>
        <div class="page-grid">
          <div class="page-card">
            <h3>🚚 Free 7-Day USA Shipping</h3>
            <p>Fast, reliable freight delivery direct to your residential or business address across all 50 US states, fully insured from our warehouse.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="page-card">
            <h3>🛡️ 100-Day Warranty</h3>
            <p>Comprehensive manufacturer warranty coverage safeguarding your electric motor, lithium battery pack, controller, and main frame.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="page-card">
            <h3>🔄 30-Day Returns</h3>
            <p>Hassle-free 30-day money-back guarantee on unused bikes in original packaging so you can shop with complete peace of mind.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="page-card">
            <h3>🇺🇸 California-Based Team</h3>
            <p>Local American customer service, transparent communication, and dedicated after-sales care based in Dinuba, CA.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section about-story">
        <h2>Our Story</h2>
        <p>Bike Bee was born out of frustration with long shipping waits, lack of replacement parts, and absent customer support in the electric dirt bike sector. As passionate riders who spent weekends carving California trails on early-generation electric bikes, our founders realized riders deserved a dedicated, US-based company that treats electric off-roading with the professionalism of traditional powersports.</p>
        <p>Today, Bike Bee is proud to serve riders throughout the United States. Whether you're exploring backcountry singletrack, training on private motocross tracks, or enjoying open farmland, we're here to power your journey with world-class machines and unmatched support.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="page-cta-box">
        <h2>Ready to Ride?</h2>
        <p>Join the electric revolution and discover the instant torque, whisper-quiet stealth, and pure exhilaration of the 2026 Sur-Ron Light Bee X.</p>
        <div class="page-cta-actions">
          {%- assign main_product = all_products['2026-surron-light-bee-2'] | default: collections.all.products.first -%}
          <a href="{{ main_product.url | default: '/products/2026-surron-light-bee-2' }}" class="page-btn page-btn--primary">Shop Light Bee X</a>
          <a href="/pages/contact-us" class="page-btn page-btn--secondary">Contact Support</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer class="page-disclaimer">
        <p>This document is for informational purposes and does not constitute legal advice. &copy; {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} Bike Bee. All rights reserved.</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
